{
  "slug": "scalekit-mcp-auth",
  "name": "Scalekit Mcp Auth",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Secure MCP servers with OAuth 2.1, token introspection, dynamic client registration, and CIMD so AI agents can call your MCP tools with verified identities",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**, **2 agents**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `add-auth-fastmcp` (Add OAuth 2.1 authorization to FastMCP servers using Scalekit provider plugin), `express-mcp-server`, `fastapi-fastmcp`, `mcp-auth` (Guides users through adding OAuth 2.1 authorization to Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers using Scalekit), `production-readiness-scalekit` (Walks through a structured production readiness checklist for Scalekit MCP authentication implementations)\n- **Agents** (2): `scalekit-mcp-auth-troubleshooter` (Diagnose and resolve common Scalekit MCP auth integration issues (handshake/metadata, cached clients, CORS/network, Claude Desktop port limits, browser…), `setup-scalekit` (Sets up Scalekit env vars, installs/initializes the SDK, and verifies credentials by listing organizations)\n- **Hooks** (1): `Stop`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `scalekit`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install scalekit-mcp-auth@claude-community` from `scalekit-inc/claude-code-authstack` (`plugins/mcp-auth`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
